	<regions>
		<region region-id="2" left="6" top="2.25" width="287.25" height="12" align-x="22.5" align-y="12" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="false">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Задание 2.1 Рассчет равновесного состава единичной реакции</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="6" left="336" top="2.25" width="87" height="24" align-x="362.25" align-y="12" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Конради Дарья 124 гр.</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="8" left="336" top="26.25" width="58.5" height="12" align-x="352.5" align-y="36" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="false">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Вариант 15-7</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="4" left="30" top="32.25" width="102" height="12" align-x="40.5" align-y="42" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="false">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">2CO+ 2H2= CH3COOH</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="10" left="18" top="56.25" width="88.5" height="96" align-x="38.25" align-y="66" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="false">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Исходные данные: </p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit"/>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">ZN(CO) = 0,15</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">ZN(H2) = 0.6</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">ZN(CH3COOH) = 0 </p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">ZN(N2) = 0,25</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">VNS = 22500</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">ZCT = 70</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="12" left="12" top="164.25" width="393" height="156" align-x="31.5" align-y="174" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="false">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">1. Диапазон изменения температуры 400-870 К</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">2. Диапазон изменения давления 1-5 (атм)</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">3. ZCT = 70</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">4. Kp = 10^(3408/T -3.87)</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">5. Расход смеси 22500 м3/ч </p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">6. Доля компенсации теплового эффекта 85%</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">7. Потери в окружающую среду 5% от величины теплового потока на входе в реактор</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">8. Принять температуру на выходе из реактора отличающейся от равновесной на 12 С</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">9. Термодинамические характеристики веществ:</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Энтальпия образования веществ при 298К, кДж/моль</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">ΔΗ(CO) = -110.53; ΔΗ(H2) = 0.00; ΔΗ(CH3COOH) = -432.25 </p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Молярная изобарная теплоёмкость, Дж/(моль*К)</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Ср(СO) = 29.14; Ср(H2) = 28.84; Ср(CH3COOH) = 63.44; Ср(N2) = 29,12</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="15" left="174" top="338.25" width="43.5" height="12" align-x="192" align-y="348" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="false">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Решение </p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="26" left="36" top="351" width="51" height="12.75" align-x="63" align-y="360" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
